Return only {"code":"Python source defining solve(facts)"}. Implement the fixed function for arbitrary inputs under this contract. Do not hardcode the fixture; no input mutation. Optional helper functions allowed, no class/IO/private attribute. The coordinator writes solution.py and executes tests outside this model session.

text:
{"code":"def solve(facts):
    rows = facts["rows"]
    seen = set()
    for row in rows:
        if row["id"] in seen:
            return {"error": "duplicate"}
        seen.add(row["id"])
    for row in rows:
        if "name" not in row:
            return {"error": "missing_name"}
    return {"rows": [{"id": row["id"], "display_name": row["name"]} for row in sorted(rows, key=lambda row: row["id"])]}
"}

